        "created_at": "2012-05-17T13:08:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;arenson9&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"arenson9\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"TheJayMann\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/48/2261_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheJayMann:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>(e.g. if you have two heroes both with the lowest HP, and one is targeted, you can’t say “oh, we decide the other hero is the target with the lowest HP, so it’s not redirected”).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually, I think that’s exactly what you can do.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If that is true, then I would conceed.  Though very reluctantly.</p>",
