      {
        "id": 30377,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-17T18:00:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would argue that you can not choose to NOT be the hero with the lowest HP, so you HAVE to redirect it. If you are all tied, then you can choose to redirect it to yourself, and it would take -1 on damage, but you can’t decide to not be the hero with the lowest.</p>\n<p>Honestly, though, I can’t think of many instances in which you would WANT the villain to deal more damage to you. (I know there ARE, I’m just saying there aren’t many, and taking 1 less damage can be pretty useful.)</p>",
