        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-14T21:18:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The problem being that Smoke Bombs has a tendency to even out the heroes’ health, so if it’s cold it will eventually hit AZ and he’ll be at the top to be hit by all the other cold attacks.</p>",
